    <artifactId>malai-acceptance-test-commons</artifactId>
    <name>Malai Acceptance Test Commons</name>
    <description>
        Shared acceptance-test scaffolding for malai services: Kensa BDD base class, WireMock wiring,
        HTTP-client stub, Cognito JWKS stub, TestId interaction capturing, database truncation, etc.
        Each service provides only the service-specific bits (app boot function, WireMock party lookup,
        domain fixture interfaces).
    </description>

